    <p>
        Chittorgarh is far more than one fort. Within the city you will find towers, palaces and temples that tell the story of
        Mewar, and within an easy drive there are wildlife sanctuaries, waterfalls and some of the most visited temples in
        Rajasthan. Here are the <strong>12 best places to visit in Chittorgarh</strong>, with approximate distances and tips
        on covering them by taxi.
    </p>

