    <h2>Getting Around Chittorgarh</h2>
    <p>
        Public transport to the fort and the out-of-town attractions is limited, so a private taxi is the most comfortable
        and time-efficient way to sightsee. With <a href="./">Chittorgarh Taxi Services</a> you choose the car, set your own
        pace and pay transparent per-km fares &ndash; see our <a href="./#fleet">fleet and fares</a>.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Start early to finish the fort before the afternoon heat.</li>
        <li>October to March is the most pleasant season; July to September is best for Menal.</li>
        <li>Dress modestly for temple visits and carry a scarf or cap.</li>
        <li>Keep some cash for entry tickets, parking and local guides.</li>
    </ul>

